    "headline": "RBI's early FCNR(B) deposit scheme closure 'data-driven' or a policy U-turn? Governor Malhotra explains",
    "body": "RBI Governor Sanjay Malhotra defended the FCNR(B) deposit scheme's early closure. He stated the decision was data-driven and a prudent calibration. This move aims to attract $80 billion into India's economy. The central bank cited stronger than expected dollar inflows for the adjustment. The RBI remains committed to managing exchange rate volatility and market conditions.",
