    "headline": "Govt organises awareness session on EU CBAM for exporters",
    "body": "Indian exporters received an awareness session on the EU's Carbon Border Adjustment Mechanism regulations. This mechanism, effective January 1, imposes a carbon tax on specific imported goods. The session covered the framework, applicable products, and reporting requirements for exporters. Practical case studies for iron, steel, and aluminium sectors were also discussed. Exporters were urged to prepare for these emerging international sustainability requirements.",
