    "body": "The Bharat International Rice Conference 2026 will showcase 200 rice varieties and 50 global cuisines. This event will be held in New Delhi from October 23 to 25. Nine experience zones will highlight rice through culture, technology, and nutrition. The conference will trace rice cultivation, consumption, and trade across generations. It will also examine rice's role in shaping global trade networks.",
