    "body": "India plans its first cargo ship voyage along the Northern Sea Route next year. Russia's Arkhangelsk region is discussing economic potential and collaboration with New Delhi. Opportunities include shipbuilding and utilizing port facilities for cargo movement. The Northern Sea Route offers significant distance and time savings for European trade. This initiative further strengthens existing connectivity and trade between India and Russia.",
