    "headline": "ICRA estimates India's GDP growth at four-quarter low of 7 per cent in April-June",
    "body": "India's GDP growth forecast stands at seven percent for the April-June quarter, marking a four-quarter low and a slowdown from prior growth rates. The industrial sector is projected to expand by seven point seven percent, with agriculture and services also seeing improvements. Overall growth is expected to moderate, yet nominal GDP growth is set to reach a remarkable four-year high.",
